      "jcr:created": "Thu Jul 14 2022 19:12:10 GMT+0000",
      "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
      "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-8em\"><sup>1</sup> Stryker's Total Stroke portfolio is a comprehensive suite of thrombectomy tools. Products included in the ASSIST Registry are: FlowGate<sup>2</sup> and Merci balloon guide catheters, Trevo ProVue Retrievers, AXS Catalyst 5/6/7 distal access catheters, AXS Vecta 71/74 intermediate catheters, and AXS Infinity LS and LS Plus long sheaths.<br>\n <sup>2</sup>&nbsp;Rounded to the nearest whole number.</span></p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Dec 12 2025 23:17:31 GMT+0000",
